{"strongs": "H4923", "word": "מְשַׁמָּה", "translit": "me.sham.mah", "root": "משמה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "devastation, waste", "definition": "מְשַׁמָּה noun feminine = שַׁמָּה : — absolute 1. = devastation, waste , ׳ אֶתהָֿאָרֶץ שְׁמָמָה וּמ ׳ וְנָתַתִּ Ezek 6:14 ; Ezek 33:28 , compare v Ezek 33:29 ; Ezek 35:3 , + Ezek 35:7 a, see שְׁמָמָה ; plural מְשַׁמּוֺת Isa 15:16 = Jer 48:34 . 2. horror , ׳ וְהָֽיְתָה חֶרְפָּה ֗֗֗ וּמ Ezek 5:15 . שָׁמָּה see שָׁם . שְׁמָמִית see שְׂמָמִית .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8806')\">BDB8806</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4923')\">H4923</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8805')\">BDB8805</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8807')\">BDB8807</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מְשַׁמָּה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> = <bdbheb>שַׁמָּה</bdbheb>: — absolute <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> = <highlight>devastation, waste</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶתהָֿאָרֶץ שְׁמָמָה וּמ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְנָתַתִּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 6:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,6,14)\">Ezek 6:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,28)\">Ezek 33:28</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Ezek 33:29\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,29)\">Ezek 33:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 35:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,35,3)\">Ezek 35:3</ref>, + <ref ref=\"Ezek 35:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,35,7)\">Ezek 35:7</ref>a, see  <bdbheb><reflink>שְׁמָמָה</reflink></bdbheb>; plural <bdbheb>מְשַׁמּוֺת</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Isa 15:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,16)\">Isa 15:16</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 48:34\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,34)\">Jer 48:34</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>horror</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְהָֽיְתָה חֶרְפָּה ֗֗֗ וּמ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 5:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,5,15)\">Ezek 5:15</ref>. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>שָׁמָּה</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>שָׁם</reflink></bdbheb>. <bdbheb>שְׁמָמִית</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>שְׂמָמִית</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ezek 6:14", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 6, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Ezek 33:28", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 33, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Ezek 33:29", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 33, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Ezek 35:3", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 35, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ezek 35:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 35, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 15:16", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Jer 48:34", "book": "JER", "chapter": 48, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Ezek 5:15", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 5, "verse": 15}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מְשַׁמָּה", "שַׁמָּה", "׳", "אֶתהָֿאָרֶץ שְׁמָמָה וּמ", "וְנָתַתִּ", "שְׁמָמָה", "מְשַׁמּוֺת", "וְהָֽיְתָה חֶרְפָּה ֗֗֗ וּמ", "שָׁמָּה", "שָׁם", "שְׁמָמִית", "שְׂמָמִית"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB8806", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}